Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.34,0:00:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.70,0:00:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Howdy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.61,0:00:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Hatake, Noko Hatake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but everyone calls\Nme field these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.28,0:00:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just a regular old student in Japan,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then all of a sudden,\Nthat anime thing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was reborn in another world,\Nas a field of all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.28,0:00:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm 100 meters long on each\Nside and 10 meters deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.54,0:00:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, let me introduce\Nyou to my lovable family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See that sleek fellow with black\Nfeathers, three eyes, and three legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Kuroyata, the ruler of the skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.16,0:00:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The party animal with a cute horn who\Nloves rushing into danger. Bow time!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.86,0:00:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sluffle of sharp ears and fuzzy faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meet the dad, Usatta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.18,0:00:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama Ussarina and kiddos,\NUsarion and Usappi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.32,0:00:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my family for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.98,0:00:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait, there's more!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.94,0:01:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This grateful ground has close pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.74,0:01:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kikuyu, the recently grown-up snow fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.54,0:01:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, we're so close,\Nshe's basically family.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.34,0:01:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's my interpreter,\Nso I owe her big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.88,0:01:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And someone whose captivating eyes\Nalmost made me accidentally fall in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.82,0:01:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lovely head of the fortified city\Nwith a truly bewitching gaze, Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.62,0:01:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's sharp as a tack and looks\Nlike a standard-issue butler.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.68,0:01:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.62,0:01:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Expressionless, potty-mouthed,\Nand so gosh-darn fond of animals,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.62,0:01:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she has a tendency to gush over\Nthem to an uncomfortable degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.76,0:01:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.34,0:01:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She dresses like a knight,\Nbut she's actually a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.50,0:01:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though she seems like\Nthe epitome of capable,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.62,0:01:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she's more of a hot mess than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Hayachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.16,0:01:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Qyoehkotek is the vampire\Nnecromancer with an impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.56,0:01:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,name who runs hot and cold\Nand is the left-leg general.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.84,0:01:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those awesome peeps are my support system.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.14,0:01:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to them, my time as a sentient field\Nhas been peaceful and pleasantly boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.78,0:02:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, except for that one time I\Nfought the Demon Lord's army.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.64,0:02:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After a fierce duel with the Demon\NLord's former left-leg general,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my consciousness was interrupted, and\NI lost my sense of self for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.86,0:02:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The days melted away as I\Ndrifted through darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I nearly went mad from the loneliness,\Nuntil one day, out of nowhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.78,0:02:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the light returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.04,0:02:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The darkness was gone, replaced by my\Nfriends and family in a world of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.38,0:02:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, that was just a few weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.70,0:02:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I was spiraling into madness,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.58,0:02:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Qyoehkotek was spreading my top-tier\Nveggie seeds and seedlings around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fixed the little starvation issue\Nplaguing the Demon Lord's domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.10,0:02:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This made the Demon Lord pro-field,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.48,0:02:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I was soon invited to his\Ncastle so we could begin peace
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.74,0:02:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,negotiations between his Demon\Nforces and the fortified city.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.92,0:02:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shui, now you're up to speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.60,0:02:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silly field, you've been monologuing\Nfor almost three minutes straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:02:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever am I going to do with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.34,0:03:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kikoyu! You!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.56,0:03:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you've blossomed\Ninto such a beauty queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.36,0:03:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's sweet of you to say, though I'm\Nunaccustomed to receiving such compliments.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.26,0:03:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piece, I totally forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.16,0:03:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can hear my innermost thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.06,0:03:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with all the\Nshameless flirting over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.58,0:03:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And more importantly, why\Nisn't any of it directed at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.20,0:03:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Qyoehkotek.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.11,0:03:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though she saved the\Ndemon realm from famine
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and became the new\Nleft-legged general to boot,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.12,0:03:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that overachiever still spends\Nher days tending to my gardens.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.10,0:03:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But on a positive note, you've really\Ngotten the hang of moving around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.68,0:03:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hardly feel the\Nground shaking anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're doing so much better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.40,0:03:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.31,0:03:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been practicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.44,0:03:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These Field feet are taking\Nus to the Demon Lord's castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.70,0:03:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whaaaaaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.61,0:03:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.52,0:03:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But inside, I've still got a human soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.84,0:03:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of wonders,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.34,0:04:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I travel to and fro on the back\Nof my super strong partner, Lamas!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.72,0:04:07.76,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.94,0:04:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo. Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.58,0:04:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.82,0:04:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.56,0:04:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, no, that's me.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.00,0:05:17.96,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(357,1)\fscx90\pos(409,56.4)}I Am a Field without Equal
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.96,0:05:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm beyond stoked to visit\Nthe Demon Lord's castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.34,0:05:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a surprisingly decent person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.50,0:05:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've spoken a handful\Nof times at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.18,0:05:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kind of like the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.30,0:05:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun barely shines in the Demon Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.88,0:05:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a barren place\Nwhere crops won't grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till now, I've been working\Nmy bountiful booty off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.72,0:05:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To modify the veggies I produce?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.32,0:05:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into hardy, drought-resistant cultivars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're spreading like wildfire\Naround the demon realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.24,0:05:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,making mincemeat of that\Nnasty food shortage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.90,0:05:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that we're not desperate for\Nresources, we've even stopped warmongering.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.76,0:05:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A happy side effect is that\Neveryone in the demon realm
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.48,0:05:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has been treating me like\Nsome kind of heroic hotshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me, a humble field!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know I don't like it\Nwhen you're overly modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.00,0:06:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why shouldn't everyone be in awe of the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.86,0:06:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,person who made those\Nlife-saving vegetables?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.54,0:06:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so nice, Kikoyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.94,0:06:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, I was hoping\Nyou could tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.22,0:06:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About that other Japanese guy you met?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.96,0:06:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who was reborn as an inanimate\Nobject in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.26,0:06:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'd be happy to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.60,0:06:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.51,0:06:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are the odds that another Japanese\Ndude would be reincarnated here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.50,0:06:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was reborn as a vending machine and\Nnow wanders the dungeon. Righteous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.18,0:06:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's even random by anime standards!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.62,0:06:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Er, says I, the guy who\Nwas reborn as a field.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.22,0:06:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.34,0:06:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I clearly remember him saying\Nhe was a vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.10,0:06:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has the ability to transform\Ninto different types of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.90,0:06:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,vending machine at will and\Ndispense the associated products.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.48,0:06:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds like he helped\Nyou out of a ripe pickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.20,0:06:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So once we settle our problems here, I'm\Nthinking we should go and return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.76,0:06:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.74,0:06:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe the left-armed\Ngeneral's been plotting in the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.94,0:06:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.90,0:07:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, I'm\Nstaying right by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just one little problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.86,0:07:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I ask Qyoehkotek for help when\Nshe's the new left-legged general?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.58,0:07:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll have to shoot my\Nshot and see what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.30,0:07:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No stalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.21,0:07:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's now or never.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.34,0:07:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course I'll stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.06,0:07:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Demon Lord is ultimately just my boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.84,0:07:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't forgotten, you're the one who\Nsaved my village in this entire realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.02,0:07:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.66,0:07:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like I have a secret\Ncrush on you or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.42,0:07:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just paying you back, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.36,0:07:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love a good tsundere trope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.64,0:07:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in all seriousness,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll assume she's being honest about\Nnot crushing on a large clump of dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.12,0:07:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just count myself lucky\Nto have such a reliable ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.28,0:07:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her ability to control the\Ndead is necromantastic,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.24,0:07:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the two of us have amazing chemistry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.54,0:07:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want good\Nchemistry, look no further.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.36,0:07:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True, it do be that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.36,0:07:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Demon Lord's castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.80,0:08:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The head honcho, looking\Neffortlessly suave as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.66,0:08:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's buff and handsome,\Nnot to mention charismatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.68,0:08:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On paper, it looks like\Nan overwhelming defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.90,0:08:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not today, demon lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.56,0:08:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those buff arms can't produce\Nlife-saving sustenance. See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.42,0:08:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not even a tiny bit jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.30,0:08:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alrighty, got that out of my system.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.32,0:08:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That elder gent is the\Nright-armed general.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.22,0:08:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He strikes me as a dandy who's\N50 but still fit as a fiddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'd continued aging like a\Nhuman, I'd probably look similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.32,0:08:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who am I kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't even look that good in my prime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.14,0:08:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me for literally treading on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.80,0:08:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's finally time for the moment of truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.52,0:08:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's hoping our peace\Nnegotiations go as expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have not seen you in a long while
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.44,0:09:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or you, my faithful left-legged\Ngeneral. It's good to see you, sire.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.11,0:09:10.98,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H0B121B&\3c&H475B7A&\shad0\fs40}Long time
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.62,0:09:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long time Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.18,0:09:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too long And drop the formalities,\NQyoehkotek Right, general?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.38,0:09:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since our realm of Lord\NField did have gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.64,0:09:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems he deserves an exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.40,0:09:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.46,0:09:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.32,0:09:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel a bit dehydrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could wet my tongue\Nwith something refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.60,0:09:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know exactly what he wants,\Nand I know, he knows, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.32,0:09:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.34,0:09:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's from freshly squeezed Barrens.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lovely. I accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.22,0:09:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.70,0:09:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it poisoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.40,0:09:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.36,0:09:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was so delectable, I felt woozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You simply must have a swig. Enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.42,0:10:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impressive recovery!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.36,0:10:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've earned yourself a little treat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.24,0:10:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so shiny! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the Demon Lord is no\Nmatch for a juicy fruit basket!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.32,0:10:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in good spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.66,0:10:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.57,0:10:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, I'm living my best life. Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.42,0:10:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:10:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha! Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:11:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's possible I overdid it on the umami.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.09,0:11:02.72,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H0B121B&\3c&H545C72&\shad0\fs30}Want to save peace talks for tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.42,0:11:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanna save peace talks for tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.02,0:11:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'd like to get this done today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.30,0:11:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.21,0:11:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the Demon Lord's army will finally\Nstop attacking the fortified city.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Usappi and Usarion!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.70,0:11:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have something for me in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.12,0:11:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought the Usatta family was off\Ninvestigating the Murderous Forest with Hayachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.46,0:11:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.72,0:11:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The left-armed general is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.52,0:11:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fiend is pulling shenanigans\Nduring pace negotiations!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.94,0:11:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem perturbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.84,0:11:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.08,0:11:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He stole the dungeon's power and now\Nhe's marching on the fortified city.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.30,0:11:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.48,0:11:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well now, the left-armed general\Nreally outdid himself this time.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.26,0:11:49.64,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H0B121B&\3c&H545C72&\shad0\fs30}Was this on your orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.60,0:11:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was this on your orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.76,0:11:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wayward general did\Nthis of his own volition.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've known that he was capable\Nof treachery for a while now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:12:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but attaining the dungeon's\Npower must have gone to his head.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.15,0:12:04.41,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (top),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H0B121B&\3c&H616E86&\shad0\fs30}Then it's no problem if I crush him?\N Left-Arm
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.20,0:12:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's no problem if I\Ncrush him? Left arm? Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll even send reinforcements\Nto help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.98,0:12:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I may, I would like\Nto undertake that duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.56,0:12:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I had in\Nmind as well. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.64,0:12:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sire, I won't fail you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.46,0:12:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wrote a letter about\Nfriending up the Demon Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.14,0:12:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then gave it to Kuroyata to\Ndeliver it to the fortified city.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.34,0:12:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We left the Demon Lord's realm and should
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.48,0:12:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be reaching the city\Nourselves before long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.60,0:12:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.51,0:12:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,once we make it there, I'll have to request\Nto speak with Lady Jessica post-haste.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.58,0:12:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.84,0:12:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the moment we lock eyes, I might go\Ninto a trance and forget why I'm there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.62,0:12:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem especially giddy when you\Nspeak with Lady Jessica, am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That observation is accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who doesn't act that way in my presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.70,0:12:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have the foggiest idea\Nwhat you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.62,0:13:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ladies in my life are\Nhaving a House fit. The cure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some fresh Utsugas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.26,0:13:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can't buy our\Nforgiveness, so don't even try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.32,0:13:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.86,0:13:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't tempt a woman with\Nfruit, you snake. Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.58,0:13:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know you want some of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.14,0:13:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't fool me, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give in to temptation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.62,0:13:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Field, stop being so creepy. Creepy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.02,0:13:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that dirtbag thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.34,0:13:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A few stray thoughts and\Nthey're teaming up against me.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.78,0:13:33.99,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\fs20\fad(446,1)\pos(150,180)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.34,0:13:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We love Field!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.48,0:13:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.58,0:13:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's lovely to see you.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.05,0:13:52.81,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H607CA1&\3c&H16233C&\shad0\fs30}Good to be back
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.28,0:13:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.82,0:13:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you seem to be thriving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.26,0:14:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to be a field,\Nnot an active volcano!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.72,0:14:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.90,0:14:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jessica's a dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.98,0:14:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bodacious dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.08,0:14:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But my brain must master my hormones!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just say this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.22,0:14:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're making Field uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please take your hands off him at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.54,0:14:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you truly uncomfortable,\Nmy precious guardian?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.46,0:14:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it really so wrong for\Nme to stroke you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.34,0:14:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may be afield, but I'm still a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.76,0:14:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't say yes when those\Ndazzling eyes are staring at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.96,0:14:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welp, I guess I'll plead the fifth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer already. You're waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.66,0:14:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes you uncomfortable,\Ndoesn't it, field?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.88,0:14:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.79,0:14:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The path of retreat has been blockaded!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.04,0:14:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Requesting immediate backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dang, looks like I'm on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.00,0:14:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's clear things up, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.06,0:14:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had to decide between the\Nthree of us, who would you choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's an intriguing suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.46,0:14:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have absolutely no\Nromantic interest in you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.42,0:14:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if you insist on being with me,\NI'll give it serious consideration.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.94,0:14:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.02,0:15:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you choose me, I swear\NI'll devote my life to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.66,0:15:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.57,0:15:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick reminder, I'm a field?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.58,0:15:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last time I checked, fields\Ndon't have harem battles?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.52,0:15:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.43,0:15:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you all forget your crazy pills?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.04,0:15:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a field! Pack dirt! Whip chow! Answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.36,0:15:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emergency Destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.68,0:15:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These babies are all yours if you help me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.82,0:15:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think of a plan to be\Nthe Left Arm General.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.36,0:15:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.56,0:15:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shall indulge in those\NUtsukas after our War Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.08,0:15:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.99,0:15:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I narrowly\Navoided disaster. But wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.32,0:15:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fortified city's under attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.18,0:15:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So shouldn't we have started\Nthe War Council ASAP?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this charade finally over?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.10,0:15:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're finished, we should\Nbegin the War Council at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.96,0:15:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're fast approaching the final showdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.10,0:15:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo-wee!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.26,0:15:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting to fill up our bellies with piping
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.16,0:15:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out food on the\Nbattlefield's a real luxury!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.00,0:15:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It truly is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.50,0:15:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hulemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.78,0:16:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should eat something!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.22,0:16:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as soon as I finish installing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.24,0:16:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hulamy's upgrading the Cap's wagon so\Nwe can hitch it to my pimped-out pickup.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the saying goes, waste not, want not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.88,0:16:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just had to rain, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.32,0:16:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was almost finished, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.38,0:16:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rain, I'm afraid you've met your match.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.10,0:16:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold the glory of\Nponcho vending machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.36,0:16:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're for water rides in theme parks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.32,0:16:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is perfect, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We built a shelter from\Nthe concrete blocks I
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.76,0:16:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can plop out when I'm a\Ngiant vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.16,0:16:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The injured hunters can rest there\Nsafely while we rush to find our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.12,0:16:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't a moment to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.92,0:16:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if we keep on chugging along this way,\Nwe'll wind up in the Massacre Forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.94,0:16:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Murderous Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.24,0:16:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm pretty sure we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.26,0:16:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.92,0:16:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happens next will depend\Non what caused this destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.16,0:16:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The monsters or our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.20,0:17:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.44,0:17:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ones who went ahead of us were\NDirector Bear, Heavy, Karios and Gores.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and Mishuel with his\Nbig old dragon sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.14,0:17:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I bet it was that last one I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.50,0:17:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.42,0:17:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.50,0:17:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he was slowing down the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.14,0:17:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mishuel, did you stay behind all\Nalone to keep the enemy occupied?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.22,0:17:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.62,0:17:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.72,0:17:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.92,0:17:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.46,0:17:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, I never stop believing in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good work, Association. Thanks, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.34,0:17:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you the ones who torched the forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.72,0:17:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.82,0:17:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had intended to buy\Ntime via well-placed traps,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.20,0:17:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but then they were all\Ntrampled by a giant monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.46,0:17:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sadly, we had no choice but\Nto set the forest ablaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.60,0:17:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Mishuel, is that the royal\Nwe or is someone with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.70,0:17:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sister and her adorable friend showed\Nup just in the nick of time to help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:17:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayachi! Usatta! Ussarina!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:17:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can come out now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.32,0:18:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to finally meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.42,0:18:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm exceedingly grateful for everything\Nyou've done for my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.48,0:18:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are my Essig friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.38,0:18:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their names are Usata and Usarion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.80,0:18:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe those two my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.94,0:18:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They rescued me after I happened\Nupon the Four-Fingered General.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.32,0:18:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their swordsmanship is truly unmatched.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.78,0:18:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or earmanship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.98,0:18:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.94,0:18:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can sense their great strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.52,0:18:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our posse's growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.04,0:18:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One truck's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.50,0:18:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And two's better than one anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.32,0:18:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.23,0:18:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Netherlord's gone rogue?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.60,0:18:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he's not doing the bidding\Nof the Demon Lord anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.00,0:18:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.42,0:18:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Netherlord used to\Nrule over the Demon Realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.90,0:18:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he lost his throne to the current\NDemon Lord and became his subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.44,0:18:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.66,0:18:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a solid motivation\Nfor betraying the Demon Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.12,0:18:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the upside, now we only have to\Ngo ham on the Netherlord's army.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.18,0:18:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our odds of winning this\Njust got a lot better.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.06,0:19:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even still, it would be best if we could\Njoin forces with the fortified city.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.64,0:19:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad we have no way of\Ngetting in touch with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.88,0:19:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.79,0:19:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I miss email.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.71,0:19:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, up in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.72,0:19:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Kuroyata!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.90,0:19:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.18,0:19:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.22,0:19:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.80,0:19:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's Kikoyu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.76,0:19:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.76,0:19:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a little birdie pouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.80,0:19:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be some kind of letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.20,0:19:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.22,0:19:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Guardian has sent us an urgent update.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.72,0:19:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Guardian?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.76,0:19:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's a letter from Field.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.60,0:19:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.84,0:19:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does it make sense\Nthat a Field can write?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.64,0:19:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll read it aloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.30,0:19:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Howdy, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.28,0:19:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Field.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.80,0:19:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard the news from Director Bear,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.80,0:19:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'm up to date on the\Nnasty little sitch you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.94,0:19:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already spoken with the Demon Lord,\Nso what do you say we all work together?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.38,0:19:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to kick the Nether Lord's evil butt?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.60,0:19:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants to kick butt?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.78,0:19:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one aggressive, um, Field.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.44,0:20:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've included a detailed plan of\Nattack along with this here letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So please look it over carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.20,0:20:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have any questions or concerns, just\Njot them down and give them to Kuroyata.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.86,0:20:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, if you don't mind, please\Nshow the following to Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.42,0:20:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.10,0:20:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A vending machine's a weird\Nreincarnation, broseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.60,0:20:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then again, I'm a\Nfield, so I can't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.48,0:20:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's have a nice long chat\Nabout Japan when this is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.86,0:20:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love to share some delicious veggies,\Nbut I know you don't have a mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.66,0:20:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, can't wait to meet ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.20,0:20:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow, I have the feeling I'd\Nreally hit it off with this field guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.72,0:20:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever we meet, I'll gift him\Nwith some nostalgic Japanese goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.26,0:20:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, we held a strategy meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wrote down a few suggestions\Nand gave them to Kuroyata.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burning down the forest vanquished\Nquite a few of our monster foes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, we may have thinned the\Nranks of the low-level monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.90,0:20:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but nearly all of the highly\Nskilled ones still remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.54,0:21:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's go time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.88,0:21:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do everything within my\Nvending powers to support our plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.30,0:21:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I'll get to fight alongside\Nmy fellow countryman field.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.24,0:21:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just the thought of it gets me excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.68,0:21:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxxo, are you excited\Nabout something? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.78,0:21:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she psychic now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.18,0:21:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.40,0:21:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kind of seems like he's just\Nstanding around like usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.02,0:21:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you still haven't figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.98,0:21:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His lights are a dead\Ngiveaway for when he's
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.06,0:21:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going through something or feeling happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.52,0:21:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even as a vending machine, my poker face\Nleaves a lot to be desired. He lights up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.90,0:21:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pity knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.14,0:21:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's obvious, kinda. Oh, Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.38,0:21:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a shell-a-bad liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.94,0:21:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't a competition or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.44,0:21:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've known Boxo the longest,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.04,0:21:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I've spent the most time with\Nhim, so I'm definitely the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.30,0:21:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'm the first runner-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.94,0:21:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Length of time doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.02,0:21:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were a lady, this is when I'd\Nsay, don't fight over little old me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not, so I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.26,0:21:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, this is no time\Nto battle over Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, our only focus should\Nbe defeating the Netherlord.
