Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.44,0:22:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.05,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (upper left),0,0,0,,{\pos(50,60)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.05,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (bottom right),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs21\fsp1\pos(434.2,297.8)\fscx72}To the Final Showdown
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.70,0:23:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.

